# R55 (docs/R54-signal-followups.md): the prose in this repository — CLAUDE.md,
# every docs/*.md plan/results/decision document, README.md — is hand-wrapped
# and deliberately structured, not auto-wrapped. Prettier's markdown output
# (*emphasis* -> _emphasis_, reflowing) is a different house style, not a more
# correct one; running `npm run format` before this existed rewrote 51
# documents for zero benefit and would have made `git blame` useless on the
# files this project most depends on being readable. If markdown formatting
# is ever wanted here, that should be a deliberate decision reversing this
# one, not something `prettier --write .` does as a side effect of
# formatting code. (Subsumes the old standalone `LICENSE.md` entry above.)
